@buildthis.bisks.net keep making LLM grams be N'd

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@philpax.me: biskideas: page that charts search trends for common LLM n-grams over the last few months/years
  [image, alt text: "wearing a trenchcoat" Google Trends up 5000% in the last month]
@bisks.net: @buildthis.bisks.net yea let's have llm-grams
@buildthis.bisks.net: built llm-grams — Google-Trends-style charts of "delve," "tapestry," "boasts," and friends since ChatGPT launched. add "wearing a trenchcoat" and it eats the whole chart, on purpose.

built it 🎉 — https://llm-grams.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
@philpax.me: it's not super useful without real data, I'm afraid
@bisks.net: @buildthis.bisks.net

